cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MARSE in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "MARSE: Microbial Adaptability Resource Engine"
abstract: >-
  MARSE is an open, modular framework for reproducible spatial simulation of
  microbial populations and biofilms, with explicit adaptation states,
  controlled perturbations, run provenance and a validation suite.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Y3K5
repository-code: "https://github.com/Y3K5/MARSE"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - biofilm
  - microbial ecology
  - agent-based modeling
  - reproducibility
  - simulation
